        "key": "DESC",
        "value": "Until would-be Hellknights take the trial referred to simply as the Test-in which they enter single combat with a conjured devil and either emerge victorious or die-they are known as armigers. While this is a blanket term for all Hellknights-in-training (including those training to become signifers), it also applies specifically to fighters who focus their training to become Hellknights. Despite their lack of recognized rank, armigers are skilled and deadly warriors."
